# Protocol Roadmap PR Sequence

## PR-01 Format backend source

Restore readable Python source files and add formatting checks.

## PR-02 Fix docs and README consistency

Ensure README links are valid and architecture status is clear.

## PR-03 Reposition as Capability Internet Protocol

Add top-level positioning and protocol docs.

## PR-04 Extend EntityType

Add compute_node, verifier_node, reviewer_node, sponsor, protocol_treasury, relay_node, indexer_node, governance_node.

## PR-05 Add NodeProfile and PublicNodeEndpoint

Enable Entities to become nodes.

## PR-06 Add Capability model

Make capability a first-class protocol object.

## PR-07 Upgrade Invocation Ledger

Bind Invocation to caller, callee, and capability.

## PR-08 Add Proof and Verification

Add generic proof and verification layers.

## PR-09 Add Settlement Layer

Refactor rewards into SettlementRecord and SettlementParticipant.

## PR-10 Extend Wallet / TokenAccount

Add CP, AIC, CC, internal PT, stake, pending rewards.

## PR-11 Upgrade Reputation Graph

Move from category reputation to scoped reputation and graph edges.

## PR-12 Add ProtocolEvent log

Prepare future event-sourced and decentralized architecture.

## PR-13 Add Public Skill Node Closed Loop demo

Prove the minimum living network.
